{"ref":"BDB, חָרֵב⁴","hw":"חָרֵב⁴","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָרֵב</span></big>  <strong>adj. waste, desolate</strong>;—ms. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.10\">Je 33:10</a> + 5 times; fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרֵבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.3\">Ne 2:3</a> + 2 times; fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶחֳרֵבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:35\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.35\">Ez 36:35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:38\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.38\">38</a> (v. Kö<sup>i. 241</sup>);—of a city, defined <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאֵין אָדָם וּמֵאֵין בְּהֵמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.10\">Je 33:10</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.12\">12</a>; also <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.3\">Ne 2:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.17\">17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶעָרִים הֶחֳרֵבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:35\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.35\">Ez 36:35</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנְשַׁמּוֹת</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנֶּהֱרָסוֹת</span>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּצוּרוֹת יָשָׁ֑בוּ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:4\" href=\"/Haggai.1.4\">Hg 1:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:9\" href=\"/Haggai.1.9\">9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בַּיִת)</span>.","next":"BDB, חֹ֫רֶב²","prev":"BDB, חָרֵב³"}